  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Canh chua is a light, sour soup named for its tamarind broth . 'canh chua' means 'sour soup'. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "canh-chua-broth"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "Canh chua "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "uses fish, pineapple, and tomatoes in a tangy broth to create a balance of sweet, sour, and savoury. "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This recipe serves 4 as part of a spread."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use any firm white fish. Catfish is traditional in the Mekong Delta. Cod, haddock, or salmon also work well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
